      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "きみのおかげでもう少し頑張る気力が湧いてきたよ。\n新しく飲み物を売って、客に振る舞おうと思う。\n素材を持ってきてくれたら、貧民街の連中を呼んで\nそのお披露目会を開こう。一曲、踊りも頼むよ。",
        "official_en": "You've inspired me to put more work into my\ntavern—I'd like to sell new drinks for folks from\nlowtown. Would you bring the ingredients? I'll have\na launch party, and you can dance there!",
        "real_en": "You've inspired me to put more work into my\ntavern—I'd like to sell new drinks for folks from\nthe slums. Would you bring the ingredients? I'll have\na launch party, and you can dance there!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
